{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026mxgq8fe0PK1792821603.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>香港歷史博物館新增反恐怖主義教育專題展覽。</p><p></p><p>保安局局長鄧炳強、警務處處長周一鳴、國安委秘書長區志光等出席展覽開幕禮，展覽設在歷史博物館大堂，介紹多宗2019年或之後，涉及國家安全和恐怖主義的案例。</p><p></p><p>鄧炳強致辭時指，恐怖主義無分國界，強調必須居安思危，全方位提升香港整體的反恐部署，市民可透過展覽和互動裝置等，了解環球反恐形勢及本港的反恐策略，建立警覺性。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T08:03:02.985454+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":177,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T05:49:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T22:38:03.591620+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:58:13.239093+00:00","content_hash":"47fdaee1563423fd00c00b5d3f38eee8d8679040ca42d522de3e8352d9453584","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T08:03:02.985454+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}